{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fans of retro maze-chasers will recognize the twisted rules...</strong><br><br> <br>Remember the maze? The dots? The ghosts? <br>This isn\u2019t that game anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAZEBREACH\u00a0reimagines the iconic arcade nightmare as a\u00a0full-body VR horror experience\u00a0where\u00a0you\u00a0are Paco M\u00e9ndez\u2014the last human with the power to fight back against the horrors lurking in the shifting, breathing labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are twisted, but familiar:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;dots&quot; are now cursed artifacts\u2014glowing blue spheres humming with dark energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;ghosts&quot; are something far worse\u2014malformed entities that\u00a0learn\u00a0from your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;power pellets&quot;?\u00a0That\u2019s\u00a0your\u00a0hand\u2014a weaponized relic capable of destroying them\u2026\u00a0if\u00a0you time it right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\u00a0True VR Terror\u00a0\u2013 Feel every heartbeat as the walls close in around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\u00a0Strategic Survival\u00a0\u2013 Outsmart enemies that adapt to your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Classic mechanics reimagined as psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\u00a0Unlock the Truth\u00a0\u2013 Discover why\u00a0you\u00a0were chosen to wield this power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze remembers. The maze waits. The maze HUNGERS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARE TO PLAY WHEN MAZEBREACH HITS VR THIS YEAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING:\u00a0This experience may cause:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Elevated heart rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncontrollable flinching at blue lights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Permanent distrus